{"orgCode":"0555","name":"Secretary for Environmental Protection","agencyCode":"3890","agencyName":"Environmental Protection","description":"The Secretary for Environmental Protection is the cabinet-level agency responsible for protecting the environment. California Environmental Protection Agency programs reduce greenhouse gas emissions, restore and protect environmental quality, and protect public health. The Secretary coordinates the state's environmental regulatory programs and oversees the fair and consistent enforcement of environmental law, which safeguards the state's residents and promotes the state's economic vitality. The Secretary also administers environmental justice, environmental law enforcement, emergency preparedness and response, Certified Unified Program Agencies, and scientific review programs. The Secretary leads greenhouse gas emission reduction and climate change activities in state government, and is responsible for coordinating the implementation of Chapter 488, Statutes of 2006 (AB 32). The Secretary also centralizes coordination of California-Mexico border environmental efforts.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":27241,"cy":33539,"by":30867},"positions":{"py":94.1,"cy":104,"by":126},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":8802,"cy":12676,"by":16600},"nongovernmental":{"py":1076,"cy":2333,"by":2352}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/3890/0555","kind":"department","name":"Secretary for Environmental Protection","code":"0555","amounts":{"py":27241,"cy":33539,"by":30867},"positions":{"py":94.1,"cy":104,"by":126},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":9748,"cy":7953,"by":835},"special":{"py":17493,"cy":25286,"by":29732},"federal":{"py":0,"cy":300,"by":300}},"children":[{"id":"exp/3890/0555/0340","kind":"program","name":"Support","code":"0340","amounts":{"py":27241,"cy":33539,"by":30867},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":9748,"cy":7953,"by":835},"special":{"py":17493,"cy":25286,"by":29732},"federal":{"py":0,"cy":300,"by":300}},"positions":{"py":94.1,"cy":104,"by":126},"description":"0340 - SUPPORT PROGRAM\n\nThe Secretary for Environmental Protection's primary program objectives are restoring, protecting, and enhancing environmental quality, and protecting public health while fostering economic vitality. The Secretary oversees the state's environmental regulatory programs with particular emphasis on promoting \"cross-media\" coordination, enhancing risk assessment (especially for disadvantaged communities and other sensitive populations), enforcing laws consistently and fairly, and objectively measuring and reporting results.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":28374,"cy":41581,"by":46132},"Local Assistance":{"py":8745,"cy":6967,"by":3687}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/3890/0555/0340/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":9748,"cy":7953,"by":835},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":9748,"cy":7953,"by":835}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3080,"cy":3118,"by":0},"Local Assistance":{"py":6668,"cy":4835,"by":835}}}},{"id":"exp/3890/0555/0340/f0014","kind":"fund","name":"Hazardous Waste Control Account","code":"0014","amounts":{"py":296,"cy":412,"by":444},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":296,"cy":412,"by":444}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":296,"cy":412,"by":444}}}},{"id":"exp/3890/0555/0340/f0028","kind":"fund","name":"Unified Program Account","code":"0028","amounts":{"py":9184,"cy":13801,"by":16692},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":9184,"cy":13801,"by":16692}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":9184,"cy":13801,"by":16692}}}},{"id":"exp/3890/0555/0340/f0044","kind":"fund","name":"Motor Vehicle Account, State Transportation Fund","code":"0044","amounts":{"py":2366,"cy":2429,"by":3090},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":2366,"cy":2429,"by":3090}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":2366,"cy":2429,"by":3090}}}},{"id"